# Binary model artefacts and experiment output are not committed.
#
# Committed:   registry/ (manifests), cards/ (model cards), evaluation/ (reports)
# Not committed: artifacts/ (serialised weights), experiments/ (run output),
#                baselines/ (frozen numeric baselines are stored as artefacts)
#
# A model is reproducible from its registry manifest plus the pipeline that
# produced it. The binary itself is an output, not a source.

artifacts/**
experiments/**
baselines/**

!**/.gitkeep
!**/README.md
!registry/**
!cards/**
!evaluation/**
